øttkaker.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"The memories still lingered, like the faint scent of saltwater on his skin.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Professor Helga Olsen, his thesis advisor, had been a constant source of inspiration.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Her sharp mind and quick wit had pushed him to challenge his own assumptions, to question the very fabric of his research.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Luca recalled the countless debates they had engaged in, their voices rising and falling like the tides of the nearby fjord.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"As he turned a corner, the imposing façade of the university's main building came into view.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Luca's heart swelled with nostalgia, remembering the countless late nights spent typing away in the computer lab, fueled by a steady supply of coffee and determination.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"It was here, within these walls, that he had earned his Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"from the Université Paris IX - Dauphine, a testament to his unwavering dedication to his craft.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"The sound of seagulls crying overhead brought Luca back to the present.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"He smiled to himself, feeling the familiar tug of the city's charm.\"}]}"
      }
